conds; expected 142857143 nanoseconds.", "fixed_commit": "80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053", "fixed_tree": "0fcdbad377f50c1955cf9a91c621fcc3c91b2754", "fixes": [{"commit": "80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053", "parent": "a9fea9f02d494e7bee90eb172e54c980638c199d"}], "patch": "patches/80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053-1/20260924T003002Z-c2f6d204.patch", "provenance": "verbatim", "restored_source_matches": true, "runs": {"buggy": {"exit_code": 101, "log": "evidence/80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053-1/20260924T003002Z-c2f6d204/buggy.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}, "fixed": {"exit_code": 101, "log": "evidence/80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053-1/20260924T003002Z-c2f6d204/fixed.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}, "restored": {"exit_code": 101, "log": "evidence/80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053-1/20260924T003002Z-c2f6d204/restored.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}}, "test_sources": [{"commit": "80601003b3fbc993dc23e65d5c7c476970ba9053", "paths": ["time/src/duration.rs"]}], "tests": ["duration::checked_div_regression"]}, "shard": "time", "status": "blocked", "subject": "Fix implementation of `Duration::checked_div`", "summary": "Duration::checked_div truncated the seconds carry and nanoseconds contributions separately, losing a nanosecond when their remainders should combine. Dividing Duration::new(1, 1) by 7 returned 142857142 nanoseconds instead of 142857143. The fix combines both remainders before division. The commit adds the detecting regression test; its integration target requires --all-features. This plan reverses only the implementation method; no tests were executed.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:33:28.675377+00:00"}
